   "widgets_values": [
    "老照片修复",
    "The photo shows two young Chinese women, about 20 years old, adult young women (not children, not teenagers), photographed in a plain Chinese photo studio in the 1970s-1980s. They are Chinese, East Asian: East Asian eyes, black hair, East Asian skin tone. They are natural, clean and youthful, little or no makeup, wearing simple era-appropriate clothing. The two women have clearly different faces and must not be averaged into one similar face: the woman on the left has a rounder, fuller face with softer features; the woman on the right has larger, brighter and more expressive eyes, more defined eyebrows and a slightly more defined nose on a slightly slimmer face. Reconstruct each woman's eyes, eyebrows and nose individually from what is visible in the damaged original, keeping each one's own character.",
